{"id":714,"gn":"Pokémon Ondes","ft":["Il apprécie les grottes les plus sombres. Ses grandes oreilles lui permettent de générer des ultrasons d’une fréquence de 200 000 Hz.","Les ultrasons à 200 000 Hz qu’il émet suffiraient à rendre groggy le plus chevronné des lutteurs.","Il adore les fruits et, en véritable gourmet, il ne mange que ceux qui sont bien mûrs. Il utilise ses ultrasons pour déterminer le degré de maturité.","Il vole à la recherche de fruits à manger. Il peut déterminer si un fruit est mûr ou non grâce à ses ultrasons.","À la tombée de la nuit, il quitte la grotte où il réside et s’envole à la recherche de fruits mûrs avec ses ultrasons.","Il peut contrôler des ondes à n’importe quelle fréquence du spectre. Même les plus grands Pokémon ne peuvent supporter ses ultrasons."],"fv":{"23":0,"24":1,"25":0,"26":1,"29":2,"30":3,"33":4,"34":5},"gr":4,"cr":190,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Aérien","Draconique"],"gw":"medium","gm":{"za":[0,186],"svmask":[0,88],"sv":[0,303],"swcrown":[0,181],"sw":[0,176],"usum":[0,83],"usum*":[0,83,3,29],"xy":[2,113]},"f":{"714":{"n":"Sonistrelle","t":["flying","dragon"],"s":[40,30,35,45,40,55],"h":0.5,"w":8,"a":[[119,0],[151,0],[140,1]],"av":["za","svmask","sv","swcrown","sw","usum","xy"],"ls":[{"l":[[33,1],[71,1],[16,4],[48,8],[104,12],[17,16],[44,20],[314,24],[18,28],[162,32],[403,36],[103,40],[355,44],[366,49],[542,52]],"m":[19,36,76,94,97,129,141,156,162,164,168,182,200,203,214,241,247,253,257,263,269,280,304,314,332,337,366,369,399,403,404,406,421,434,512,528,542,814,851],"e":[407,432]},{"l":[[71,1],[33,1],[16,4],[48,8],[104,12],[17,16],[44,20],[314,24],[18,28],[162,32],[403,36],[103,40],[355,44],[366,49],[542,52]],"m":[19,76,94,97,103,129,141,156,164,168,173,182,200,203,211,213,214,231,241,247,253,257,263,269,280,304,369,399,403,404,406,421,496,512,528,542],"e":[407,432],"t":[434,814]},{"l":[[103,1],[48,1],[33,1],[71,5],[16,11],[44,13],[17,16],[97,18],[314,23],[355,27],[13,31],[366,35],[18,40],[162,43],[403,48],[542,58]],"m":[19,76